### 1. 회원 목록조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/members

### 1-2. 선택 조건
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/members?name=신

### 1-3 회원 단건조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/members/6

### 1-4 회원 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "reder01",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "email": "reafer01@test.com"
}

### 2. 도서 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/books

### 2-1. 도서 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/books/10

### 2-2. 도서 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/library/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring REST API 입문",
  "author": "오지라퍼",
  "isbn": "979-11-1111-111-1",
  "publishedAt": "2025-03-10"
}